        "created_at": "2025-08-16T06:35:10.526Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Sir In my course portal it was written that “OPPE AND SCT APPROVAL - 1.00” which meant that I would be eligible for the oppe which will be happening on 16th august.</p>\n<p>Sir I wasted my whole week for preparing for the oppe only and was not able to submit my assignment of all the courses I had registered for.</p>\n<p>I got to know that I will be not considered for the oppe on 16th only when saw it in looker studio.</p>\n<p>Sir I have submitted 2 out of 4 bpt assignments and got 100 and 75 in the respective assignments . I was not able to submit bpt 1 as I did not knew how to do it</p>\n<p>and I did not knew that bpt3 was released because at that time I was preparing for my other courses and didn’t get the announcement for it .</p>\n<p>Sir I humbly request you to kindly allow me for the oppe exam next week  and I promise you that I will pass the oppe with good marks</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "posts_count": 2,
