        "created_at": "2025-08-16T09:19:30.841Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Eligibility for OPPE is 40 or greater (in average) in first 3 BPTs.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-ds-students\" data-username=\"23f1000883\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"184983\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://dub1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/user_avatar/discourse.onlinedegree.iitm.ac.in/23f1000883/48/144632_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> 23f1000883:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>course portal it was written that “OPPE AND SCT APPROVAL - 1.00</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This is for the SCT and it has nothing to do with course eligibility for any course.</p>",
